  "description": "Drop-in replacement for Avalonia.Skia and Avalonia.Vulkan 12.1.5 that renders Avalonia with Skia Graphite (Vulkan on Windows, Metal on macOS) through SkiaSharp 4.154.0. Enabled by default with optimal settings (2 adaptive pipelined balanced bands, direct target, ordered recordings, serialized band snaps, built-in pipeline prewarm, and 1 ms Windows Vulkan timer resolution); every option is configurable in C# via GraphiteSettings / GraphiteOptions or environment variables.",
